abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching tool (AI Teaching Demos) for executives: decompose a business into nested
  boxes (business stages, human steps, AI capabilities, data stores, external systems) connected by
  process and data-flow arrows; tag each AI step with one of 12 plain-language AI types, inputs,
  outputs, deployment location, business value and implementation difficulty; tag data with
  storage location and sensitivity. One-click statistics, a value/difficulty quadrant, red/yellow
  alerts for sensitive data flowing to the public cloud, and a Markdown export. Three fictional
  worked examples with narrated walkthroughs. No libraries, no network; works on desktop and phones.
